## Technical Details

### Rune System

DK rune mechanics work at any level:
- 2 Blood, 2 Frost, 2 Unholy runes
- Cooldown-based resource
- Death runes (convertible) via Blood Tap
- No scaling required, base mechanic

### Disease Mechanics

Diseases use base spell ranks:
- Frost Fever (rank 1)
- Blood Plague (rank 1)
- Appropriate damage for level 1-20
- Spread via Pestilence, consumed by Blood Boil

### Presences (Stances)

All three presences at level 10:
- Blood: DPS (+15% damage, heals on strike)
- Frost: Tank (+armor, +threat, +stamina)
- Unholy: Speed (+15% haste, +15% movement)

Matches other classes getting specs/stances around level 10.

### Configuration

**worldserver.conf:**
```
StartHeroicPlayerLevel = 1  # DKs start at level 1
```

