## Why This Matters

**Class Parity**

Without this fix:
- Warriors, paladins, rogues: Level 1-20
- Death Knights: Level 55-80
- DKs unusable for 1-20 gameplay

With this fix:
- All classes start at level 1
- All classes viable for compressed progression
- DKs are an option, not an exception

**Unique Mechanics Preserved**

Didn't just give DKs warrior abilities. Kept:
- Rune resource system
- Disease application and spreading
- Presence stances (Blood/Frost/Unholy)
- Hybrid plate melee/caster identity

Scaled power level, not identity.

**Design Space**

DKs bring mechanics no other class has:
- Diseases (DoT-based damage)
- Runes (cooldown resource, not rage/energy/mana)
- Raise Dead (pet at level 20)
- Death Coil (spellpower-based plate class)

This expands build diversity. Roguelike thrives on options.

**Streamlined Kit**

Removed 4 abilities (Death Grip, Path of Frost, Mind Freeze, Icebound Fortitude) to:
- Avoid "too many buttons" syndrome
- Remove overpowered low-level utility (Death Grip pull)
- Match simplicity of other 1-20 class kits

15 abilities by level 20 is comparable to paladin, warrior progression.

