## Phase 2 Contribution

This issue enables **Phase 2: Empty World** by ensuring:
> "All classes are viable in the compressed 1-20 experience"

Death Knights weren't designed for level 1-20. But the empty world needs all playstyles:
- Plate tank (Frost DK)
- Plate DPS (Blood/Unholy DK)
- Hybrid melee/caster (Death Coil, diseases)
- Pet class (Raise Dead at 20)

By scaling DKs down, we add build diversity without creating imbalance. The empty world is harsh—players need every class option available.
